<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>AI Email Support Agent — Overview</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial; line-height:1.6; color:#111; padding:24px; max-width:900px; margin:0 auto; }
    header { text-align:center; margin-bottom:18px; }
    h1 { font-size:1.8rem; margin:0 0 8px; }
    p.lead { margin:0 0 18px; color:#333; }
    section { margin-bottom:18px; }
    h2 { font-size:1.1rem; margin:12px 0; }
    ul { margin:8px 0 12px 20px; }
    ol { margin:8px 0 12px 20px; }
    pre { background:#f6f8fa; padding:12px; border-radius:6px; overflow:auto; }
    .emoji { font-size:1.05rem; margin-right:6px; }
    footer { text-align:center; margin-top:26px; color:#666; font-size:0.95rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>🤖 AI Email Support Agent</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      An automated AI system that reads customer emails, classifies them, generates replies, and sends responses — all without human involvement.  
      Designed to save businesses hours of manual support work.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2>📌 What This Agent Does</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><span class="emoji">📥</span>Watches incoming emails</li>
      <li><span class="emoji">🧠</span>Classifies messages (support, refund, product query, etc.)</li>
      <li><span class="emoji">🤖</span>Routes each email to the correct specialized AI agent</li>
      <li><span class="emoji">📚</span>Uses RAG + vector store to access company policies &amp; knowledge</li>
      <li><span class="emoji">✍️</span>Generates accurate, contextual replies</li>
      <li><span class="emoji">📊</span>Logs outputs to Google Sheets</li>
      <li><span class="emoji">✉️</span>Sends responses back through Gmail</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>🧭 How It Works (Pipeline)</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Email watcher detects new messages</li>
      <li>Emails are batched for processing</li>
      <li>Classifier predicts category</li>
      <li>Specialized agent handles the email</li>
      <li>Agent retrieves business knowledge (RAG pipeline)</li>
      <li>Reply is generated and saved</li>
      <li>Google Sheets logs everything</li>
      <li>Gmail sends the final answer to the customer</li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>🔧 Tech Used</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>LLM-based classifier</li>
      <li>Custom AI agents (support / refund / product queries)</li>
      <li>RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation)</li>
      <li>Vector store for company knowledge</li>
      <li>Google Sheets API</li>
      <li>Gmail API</li>
      <li>n8n / Make / automation workflows</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>⚙️ Setup Requirements</h2>
    <pre><code>
LLM_API_KEY=
GMAIL_CLIENT_ID=
GMAIL_CLIENT_SECRET=
GSHEETS_CREDENTIALS_JSON=
VECT_STORE_API_KEY=
SHEET_ID=
INBOX_EMAIL=
    </code></pre>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>🚀 Why Businesses Need This</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Saves hours of manual email replies</li>
      <li>Ensures fast, consistent customer support</li>
      <li>Reduces human mistakes</li>
      <li>Scales support without hiring more staff</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>📬 Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Want a custom AI agent for your business?<br />
      <strong>your-email@domain.com</strong>
    </p>
  </section>

  <footer>
    Made with ❤️ — AI Email Support Agent
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
